WEBVTT

00:12:29.331 --> 00:12:31.998
sekta ya tumbaku.
Utafiti huu umeithibithishwa.

00:12:33.069 --> 00:12:36.172
Akitoa tangazo Machi mwaka huu

00:12:36.196 --> 00:12:39.069
Mkurugenzi Mtendaji 
wa AMP Capital alisema,

00:12:39.093 --> 00:12:42.799
"Hatuko tayari kurudisha uwekezaji

00:12:42.823 --> 00:12:45.148
kwa gharama yoyote kwa jamii."

00:12:46.117 --> 00:12:48.656
Na hilo ndilo swali tunapaswa kujiuliza.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.712
Je, hamna kiwango cha msingi 
tunaweza kitiri

00:12:53.736 --> 00:12:54.886
kutengeneza faida?

00:12:56.363 --> 00:12:59.331
Katika safari hiyo,

00:12:59.355 --> 00:13:01.188
nimepata usaidizi na ushirikisho mkubwa.
Sasa kama tunajaribu